  <section class="section" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <hgroup class="section-header">
        <span class="section-badge">FAQ</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked <span class="text-accent">Questions</span></h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Find answers to common questions about our products and services.</p>
      </hgroup>
      <div class="faq-container">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">
            <span>What is GRACE software?</span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>GRACE (Governance, Risk and Control Evaluation) is a comprehensive software solution designed to help
              organisations manage their risk registers, conduct control evaluations, and maintain compliance with
              governance requirements. It provides configurable risk profiles, interactive risk maps, and detailed
              reporting capabilities.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">
            <span>How does HARRIET differ from GRACE?</span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>HARRIET (Hazard Assessment and Risk Review Identification Evaluation and Treatment) is specifically
              designed for health and safety management. While GRACE focuses on broader governance and risk management,
              HARRIET specializes in hazard identification, workplace risk assessments, and safety compliance tracking.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">
            <span>What types of organisations use your software?</span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Our software is used by a wide range of organisations including local authorities, NHS trusts,
              universities, police services, financial institutions, and private sector companies. Any organization that
              needs to manage risks, ensure compliance, or maintain health and safety standards can benefit from our
              solutions.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">
            <span>Do you provide training and support?</span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Yes, we provide comprehensive training and ongoing support for all our products. This includes initial
              implementation training, user guides, and dedicated support channels. We also offer consultancy services
              to
              help you get the most out of your risk management processes.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">
            <span>Can the software be customized for our needs?</span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Absolutely. Both GRACE and HARRIET are highly configurable to match your organization's specific
              requirements. You can customize risk categories, scoring matrices, report templates, and workflows. Our
              team
              can assist with configuration to ensure the system aligns with your existing processes.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
